ues from Lethal Ape and Starving Apes, building on their chaotic energy and tone.\nIt\u2019s a tribute to the absurd, intense worlds those games created.\n\nBig and grand environments with realistic audio force you into immersion, most objects are intractable. Giving you freedom in your experience.\n{1281249643344863}\n\nWild physics and bizarre AI behavior lead to moments that are as hilarious as they are horrifying.\nEven in the chaos, it\u2019s hard not to laugh.\n{2146649969144637}", "short_description": "Ape Redux is a VR game inspired by titles such as Lethal Ape, Lethal Ape Redux, and Starving Apes, delivering a horrifying yet absurdly funny experience."}]}, "developer_name": "MitchellGamz", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/aperedux", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MitchellGamz", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/aperedux", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "23881833214810541"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "728492016205781"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "728492016205781"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1751925660, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "728492016205781"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": 